               "Partnered with traders and analysts on rapid two-week delivery cycles to translate desk requirements into production analytics, aligning model output with evolving commercial opportunities, including expansions into Continental Europe and Japan"
            ]
        }
        />

    <Experience
        role="Quantitative Trading Analyst"
        institution="Hartree Partners"
        location="London, UK"
        startYear="2023"
        endYear="2024"
        skills={["Python", "PostgresSQL","Tableau","Crude Oil", "Refined Products"]}
        descriptions={
            [
               "Built and maintained production-grade data pipelines processing 300+ GB of trade, AIS vessel tracking, weather, and macroeconomic data (Python, SQL, web scraping), underpinning quantitative support to the European middle distillates trading desk.",
               "Developed predictive supply-demand models using machine learning techniques (XGBoost, ARIMA), incorporating refinery outages, weather, and macroeconomic indicators to forecast market balances.",
